---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import PillarCard from '../components/PillarCard.astro';
import { pillars } from '../data/pillars';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Why Change Mind, Change Body exists: free daily habits that change your mind and your body."
>
  <Hero
    eyebrow="About Us"
    title="Cost-free daily habits that change your mind and your body. That's it."
    subtitle="No paid tiers. No sign-up walls. No program to buy. Just what we've learned, shared plainly."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Why We Exist</p>
      <h2>We've lived it, studied it, and now we're sharing it.</h2>
      <p>
        Every habit on this site has been tested somewhere real — in our own training, our own
        kitchens, our own hard days. We've paired that lived experience with continued education
        in exercise science, nutrition, supplementation, mental health, and immune wellness, and
        distilled it down to the habits that actually move the needle.
      </p>
      <p>
        We didn't build this to sell you something. Real change doesn't come from a purchase — it
        comes from a decision, repeated daily, until it becomes who you are. Our job is just to
        make sure you're never short on good information to build that decision around.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--muted">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">What "Free" Means Here</p>
      <h2>No sign-up. No paywall. No catch.</h2>
      <p>
        Nothing on Change Mind, Change Body is gated behind an email address, a subscription, or a
        program purchase. We're not building a funnel — we're building a resource. Read what's
        useful, take what applies to your life, and come back whenever you need the next habit.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">The Five Pillars</p>
      <h2>Everything we share fits into one of these.</h2>
      <div class="grid-pillars">
        {pillars.map((pillar) => <PillarCard pillar={pillar} />)}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--muted">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Change your mind. Change your body. Change everything that comes after.</h2>
      <p>
        You don't need a program to start. You need one habit, done today, and then again
        tomorrow. Pick a pillar above and start there.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
